# Git workflow

- Treat **`main`** as the default working branch. Before starting work, ensure the repo is on `main` (`git checkout main`) unless the user explicitly asks for another branch.
- Put finished changes on **`main`** or a branch the user names. Do not leave completed work only on `cursor/*` or other ephemeral agent branches.
- When creating commits, use the **system default Git identity** (global `user.name` / `user.email` as configured on the machine). Do **not** run `git config` to change local or global settings, and do not set repository-local `user.name` or `user.email`.
